					"nextDialogs": [
						150080402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080402,
					"content": "这是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080403,
					"content": "这是我们进入鳍游龙聚会的钥匙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080404,
					"content": "如果鳍游龙的嗅觉也十分敏锐，那么即便我们努力隐藏脚步声，躲避视线，只要一靠近还是会被发现。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080405,
					"content": "而这种植物正好可以解决这种问题，因为它的气味很接近鳍游龙的体味。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080406,
					"content": "用它提取一些汁液，涂抹在身上，就可以骗过鳍游龙的鼻子了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080407,
					"content": "要涂在身上啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080408,
					"content": "没关系，其实有美容效果的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080409,
					"content": "玛拉妮采集了一些汁液，给每个人都穿上了一层气味的伪装。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080410
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150080410,
					"content": "嗯…湿湿滑滑的，闻起来确实很像鳍游龙呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080411,
					"content": "完美，我们再去试一下吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "玛拉妮"
				}
			]
